.TH KINTSUGI 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi \- privacy-first agent harness for open-weights models
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi
[command] [flags]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Kintsugi is a local-first agent harness that runs open-weights models against your
codebase. It keeps your data on disk, refuses to upload telemetry, and gives
you explicit control over every tool the agent can call.
.PP
Run
.B kintsugi
with no arguments to start the interactive TUI session.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fBtui\fR
Interactive session (default)
.IP \fBrun\fR
Run one task to completion
.IP \fBplan\fR
Read-only planning turn
.IP \fBhooks\fR
Manage workspace hooks
.IP \fBaudit\fR
View permission decisions
.IP \fBprompt\fR
Inspect the compiled prompt
.IP \fBmodels\fR
List providers and models
.IP \fBpack\fR
Persona pack management
.IP \fBskills\fR
Workspace skills
.IP \fBcontext\fR
Manage CONTEXT.md
.IP \fBledger\fR
Accepted work ledger
.IP \fBtaste\fR
Operator taste preferences
.IP \fBrecall\fR
Search prior accepted work
.IP \fBpersona\fR
Persona triggers
.IP \fBmemory\fR
Lessons and skills search
.IP \fBsession\fR
Session management
.IP \fBdoctor\fR
Environment readiness check
.IP \fBrepair\fR
Tool repair statistics
.IP \fBrefusal\fR
Refusal telemetry
.IP \fBgate\fR
Opsec review gate
.IP \fBdag\fR
Run a node plan
.IP \fBrules\fR
Rule file management
.IP \fBquota\fR
Token usage vs limits
.IP \fBreport\fR
Findings report
.IP \fBinit\fR
Scaffold a workspace
.IP \fBconnect\fR
Verify and store API keys
.IP \fBsetup\fR
Install persona pack
.IP \fBnew\fR
Scaffold a project
.IP \fBvalidate\fR
Provider validation
.IP \fBcheckpoint\fR
Session snapshots
.IP \fBrewind\fR
Rewind to a checkpoint
.IP \fBkb\fR
Knowledge base management
.IP \fBlab\fR
Compose lab management
.IP \fBmods\fR
Mod manifests
.IP \fBdocs\fR
Show man pages
.IP \fBloop\fR
Self-paced loops
.IP \fBschedule\fR
Scheduled jobs from a cron expression
.IP \fBversion\fR
Print version
.IP \fBhelp\fR
Show usage
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-no\-alt\-screen\fR
Keep output in scrollback
.IP \fB\-\-no\-mouse\fR
Disable mouse-wheel scrolling
.IP \fB\-\-no\-boot\fR
Skip the boot nameplate
.IP \fB\-\-plain\fR
Force line-based REPL
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IP \fBFORGE_MODEL\fR
Override the default model
.IP \fBFORGE_MODE\fR
Override the core mode (online/offline)
.IP \fBFORGE_CONFIG\fR
Path to config file
.IP \fBFORGE_WORKSPACE\fR
Override the workspace directory
.SH EXAMPLES
Start an interactive session:
.PP
  $ kintsugi
.PP
Run a task headlessly:
.PP
  $ kintsugi run "add error handling to main.go"
.PP
Check environment readiness:
.PP
  $ kintsugi doctor
.PP
List configured models:
.PP
  $ kintsugi models
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi-run (1),
.BR kintsugi-plan (1),
.BR kintsugi-connect (1),
.BR kintsugi-loop (1),
.BR kintsugi-schedule (1),
.BR kintsugi-doctor (1)
